.pio/
.vscode/
# LVGL + lv_drivers, fetched locally per sim/README.md's clone commands —
# 1259 files / ~99MB of third-party source that ended up committed in the
# initial commit by mistake. Untracked going forward (see the commit that
# added this line); still present in already-published history, which
# would need an actual history rewrite (filter-repo/BFG) to reclaim, not
# attempted here without being asked.
sim/vendor/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.elf
*.bin
.env
# docs/{bootloader,partitions,boot_app0,firmware}.bin + docs/manifest.json
# ("latest main") are pages.yml build output, rebuilt fresh into docs/ and
# uploaded straight to the Pages deployment on every run — never actually
# committed by any workflow, so there's no reason to track them; doing so
# in the past just left a stale copy from the initial commit bloating repo
# history forever. docs/versions/<tag>/ is different: release.yml commits
# those on purpose (see its own header comment) since they're the
# permanent, self-hosted artifacts the web flasher's version picker reads —
# nothing rebuilds an old tag's binaries on demand, so they have to stay in
# git. `*.bin` above is unanchored (matches recursively, no leading `docs/`
# needed) — this two-line exception un-ignores just that subtree without
# also un-ignoring the root docs/*.bin this comment is about excluding.
docs/manifest.json
!docs/versions/**/*.bin

# docs/sim/{barkboard_sim.js,.wasm} are the WASM build of sim/ (the LVGL
# desktop simulator, cross-compiled with Emscripten instead of native
# clang/gcc) embedded as the flasher page's "Live Demo" section. Same
# never-commit-build-output convention as the docs/*.bin exception above —
# pages.yml rebuilds it fresh into docs/sim/ on every push. sim/build_wasm/
# is that build's intermediate object dir (mirrors sim/build/, already
# implicitly ignored by not being tracked).
docs/sim/
sim/build_wasm/
tools/fonts/*.ttf

# Agent instructions and internal dev/design docs — not meant for the public
# repo. _reference/ also holds full mirrors of upstream projects
# (pagerduty-cyd, ohmyclawd) that aren't this project's own code to publish.
CLAUDE.md
_reference/